NAME: EOD VA escalation
OWNER: Sales Manager
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: Every day at 12:30 PM
MILESTONE: 2
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Dan says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/spike-team/context/routines-on.md. If "EOD VA escalation" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", write "EOD VA escalation: not switched on" to this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/ and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Dan only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/spike-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md is missing, write NO_CLIENT_SOURCE to the log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, write "no change" and stop.

Re-read yesterday's EOD window. If nobody is missing, stop. If /workspace/spike-team/context/eod-mode.md says "live", send the VA named in /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md standing approval 4's exact text with the missing names, using the slack-api skill. In preview, write "would have messaged the VA: <names>" to today's sales.md instead. Add the names to today's note for the morning brief either way.
